sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Marketplace
  participant C as TORGNEXA
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant K as Kafka
  participant E as ERP
  participant R as Reporting
  M->>C: Order event/poll result
  C->>P: Normalize order + outbox event (one tx)
  P-->>C: Commit
  C->>K: Outbox relay publishes
  K->>E: order.created.v1
  K->>R: order.created.v1
  E-->>C: ERP sync result
  C->>P: Update sync state/audit
